WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.080
What's up guys!

00:00:11.080 --> 00:00:11.920
We are Pongfinity

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:13.920
We can't be more excited to be launching

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.700
Our very own table tennis racket

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.040
The Pongfinity Sensei!

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.320
And to celebrate the launch

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:23.320
We have made an exclusive edition of 100 numbered rackets

00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:26.540
And today we'll be glueing and trying them out ourselves!

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.560
So for example, if you are the fifth person to make an order

00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:31.840
You'll get this number 5 racket

00:00:33.140 --> 00:00:34.300
So be fast!

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:39.560
Let's start off with the first two rackets

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:41.400
This is the the one!

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.760
The world's most valuable Pongfinity racket

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:45.340
This is the number one!

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:46.360
Let's start glueing!

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:50.100
The glueing has begun!

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.180
This is going to be a long day!

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:56.820
Yes!

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:57.940
Let it dry!

00:01:02.860 --> 00:01:06.180
So the first ever Pongfinity racket being cut!

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:09.320
Voilá!

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:11.760
That is the first red rubber

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:14.140
There

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:16.580
Number one!

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.120
Yea

00:01:21.520 --> 00:01:22.220
Edge tape

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:28.680
That’s ready!

00:01:29.120 --> 00:01:32.580
The world’s first Pongfinity racket

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.180
Good touch!

00:01:48.560 --> 00:01:49.440
Feels good in the hand

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:51.180
Let’s test them out!

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:54.460
Let’s try one backhand

00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:55.140
Ok

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:56.200
See how this works

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:57.300
I have no idea

00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:01.080
Okay?

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:03.140
It works!

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:03.560
Or?

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:04.460
Does it?

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:07.000
Yeah it’s okay!

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:13.760
Around the net!

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:15.320
There we have it!

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:16.120
It works

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:22.380
I mean, not bad!

00:02:22.780 --> 00:02:23.820
Number one racket!

00:02:24.500 --> 00:02:25.120
Number one

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:26.020
Always number one

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:28.100
Always number two?

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:30.420
You were number two in that rally Otto!

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:34.880
But the racket, it has really good control a good spin

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:37.880
So it’s suitable for any developing player

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:41.400
One out of one hundred

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:43.460
The very first racket

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:44.960
Who will get this?

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:46.040
Pause the video

00:02:46.180 --> 00:02:48.340
Go quickly to pongfinity.store to buy it

00:02:48.340 --> 00:02:49.640
And then come back to watch the video!

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:50.680
Number one

00:02:50.980 --> 00:02:53.700
In a few years this might actually be worth something

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:55.340
Who knows?
-Yea, you never know!

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:57.040
It's like a collectable item

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:58.640
Whoever gets this

00:02:58.640 --> 00:02:59.780
Send us a message!

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:01.420
The first package done!

00:03:02.940 --> 00:03:04.540
So racket number one

00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:08.860
And two, ready to be shipped to the world!

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:12.060
Two percent done, 98 to go!

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.300
I like glueing table tennis rubbers

00:03:25.400 --> 00:03:26.480
Racket number four

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:28.040
I’ll give it a magic kiss

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:31.380
Now nobody wants it anymore

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:35.060
Perfect!

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:37.760
Yea!

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:40.700
Racket number three!

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:42.380
Half long

00:03:42.760 --> 00:03:44.460
Somebody’s gonna get a broken racket

00:03:45.860 --> 00:03:47.680
Ooohh! That was dodgy!

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:53.140
Passed the half-long check!

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:54.440
Number three and four!

00:03:54.760 --> 00:03:56.460
We are progressing!

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:58.260
Now we’re going to speed things up

00:03:58.260 --> 00:03:59.860
We’re going to do 10 rackets at a time

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:06.560
It was about 2,5 years ago

00:04:06.560 --> 00:04:08.840
When we started thinking about making our own racket

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:12.340
Feels super exciting to 
actually get this launched now

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.840
And have everything ready!

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:19.640
Ok, so the racket number six

00:04:20.460 --> 00:04:22.180
Gets six forehand loops!

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:23.620
Really?

00:04:30.140 --> 00:04:31.020
Let's pack it up!

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:33.260
But... you should have got 5 blocks?

00:04:33.400 --> 00:04:35.160
Actually you did get 5 blocks!

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:37.400
I did get!
- That's true!

00:04:49.660 --> 00:04:50.760
Whoever gets number ten

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:52.700
They'll have a secret signature under [the rubber]

00:05:03.920 --> 00:05:06.220
Otto is vibing with racket number?

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:07.380
Thirteen!

00:05:07.380 --> 00:05:08.100
Thirteen!

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:09.500
My favorite number!

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:11.900
No wonder it had good vibes!

00:05:12.200 --> 00:05:12.860
Yea!

00:05:17.480 --> 00:05:19.280
Number 13 gets a cartwheel

00:05:23.980 --> 00:05:25.980
It’s very suitable for cartwheel shots, this one

00:05:29.740 --> 00:05:32.840
This is going to take soooo long!

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:35.400
It's 5 PM currently

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:39.500
And I really can't see 
that we'd be done with this before midnight

00:05:52.900 --> 00:05:53.980
Nineteen is done!

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:55.380
Very good footwork Miikka

00:05:55.380 --> 00:05:55.940
Thanks!

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:14.760
36!

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:19.060
 1.9 millimeter thick

00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.060
We have the ITTF approval

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:25.780
So this is actually a rubber that 
you can use officially in any tournament

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:53.720
Hour 8 of glueing table tennis rackets

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:55.360
We have 46 [rackets] ready

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:56.920
Almost a hundred [rubbers]

00:06:57.440 --> 00:07:01.080
Do you guys have any suggestions 
on what we could do with these?

00:07:01.380 --> 00:07:02.680
Let us know in the comments!

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:17.440
Certificates authorized!

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:19.980
Let's test these rackets

00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:21.440
The first around the net

00:07:25.720 --> 00:07:27.980
Really good for around the nets as well!

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:28.840
50!

00:07:28.840 --> 00:07:29.420
Okay

00:07:29.540 --> 00:07:33.320
That means we are halfway 
through this whole process

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:36.860
And it's almost midnight

00:07:37.160 --> 00:07:38.900
Whoever gets number 50

00:07:39.000 --> 00:07:40.160
You'll also get...

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:42.860
A Pongfinity racket case!

00:07:42.860 --> 00:07:45.060
So you can keep your racket here

00:07:45.340 --> 00:07:48.660
That's highly recommended 
to get for your racket

00:07:48.660 --> 00:07:50.600
Very nice quality!

00:07:50.640 --> 00:07:51.960
So whoever gets the number 50

00:07:52.180 --> 00:07:53.900
You'll get it [the racket case] for free!

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:01.700
51 is of course the number 
of the behind the back shot

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:08.280
55 and 56

00:08:08.280 --> 00:08:09.800
The Pongfinity bounce challenge

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:11.260
Aaah that's nice!

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:14.560
One!
- Very good one!

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:17.780
Two!
- Nice!

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:20.160
Three!

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:22.740
Noooo!

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:24.660
57

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:41.340
I don't know why I twiddled!

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:42.600
It's past midnight

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:45.040
We have been glueing for 13 hours...

00:08:45.360 --> 00:08:47.000
The remaining blades

00:08:47.600 --> 00:08:50.860
And the remaining rubbers

00:08:51.060 --> 00:08:51.940
Let's do this!

00:09:09.720 --> 00:09:12.220
We wanted to have the colors of our logo

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:14.300
So that's why we went for black and red

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:17.960
And we thought this looked really cool
 with the black surface

00:09:17.960 --> 00:09:20.160
And with the red little stripe going through

00:09:20.260 --> 00:09:23.580
The silver lens looks so nice there!

00:09:23.680 --> 00:09:24.000
Yea

00:09:24.160 --> 00:09:26.660
And then also underneath

00:09:26.660 --> 00:09:28.960
The Pongfinity text and the logo

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:35.780
I'm done!

00:09:35.860 --> 00:09:37.100
Are you going to head home now?

00:09:37.100 --> 00:09:37.760
Yes!

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:40.200
Nice! You have earned it!

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:58.780
It's quite funny you can already hear
the birds starting to sing outside

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:01.100
Because it's 3 AM

00:10:01.420 --> 00:10:03.280
The birds are waking up

00:10:06.840 --> 00:10:09.660
We also have to thank everybody
 who has helped us with this

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:13.780
Everything from the design to the rubbers

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:14.780
And everything [else] so...

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:21.660
Big thanks to all of you have been with us
 in making this possible

00:10:22.040 --> 00:10:22.820
And of course

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:24.140
All you viewers

00:10:24.940 --> 00:10:29.800
That's pretty much the whole reason why this
 - in the first place

00:10:29.800 --> 00:10:32.780
Is even possible that we actually launched this

00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:36.580
And it feels so nice for ourselves

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:40.560
It's been sort of a dream for us
 to make an own racket

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:41.400
At some point

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:45.180
And to see it concretely now ahead of us

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:47.480
Is really, really cool

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:48.760
So thank you for that!

00:10:48.940 --> 00:10:49.820
This is the final one!

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:51.380
One hundred!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.280
Yea I think we'll keep this one [racket number 100]

00:10:54.280 --> 00:10:57.280
As a memory of this crazy idea

00:10:57.280 --> 00:11:01.840
It's surprising how much time it 
actually takes to make 100 rackets

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:05.540
98!

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:06.580
99!

00:11:06.880 --> 00:11:07.860
100!

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:08.980
Done!

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.880
Ok, it's 4 AM

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:12.920
We have the rackets ready

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:15.240
We still need to test the last 20

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.580
Good around the net with 84!

00:11:37.020 --> 00:11:37.920
Good spin!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:43.680
Don’t give me there!

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:48.400
So, that was almost 20 hours of making
 our own table tennis racket

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:50.280
What a crazy project!

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:52.760
But we are really happy how it turned out to be

00:11:52.840 --> 00:11:55.140
Hope you enjoy it as much as we do!

00:11:55.660 --> 00:11:56.100
Yea!

00:11:56.420 --> 00:11:58.060
Now, it's time to go sleep!

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:01.100
And you, go to pongfinity.store to get your racket!

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:02.200
Until next time!

